    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26b5fcb024eb6100eade3cc6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哪怕迷人景致不在……\n只要能彻底赢下『秋华赏』的话，\n就一定能够得到它。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61a6d14ca27792336e97c8f8a2aafb2cf8a2b72336e01de81f21d460d6871b76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
